      "## Gap two: there is no order desk",
      "Orders arrive on WhatsApp, on a phone call, on a slip of paper from a relative, and at the counter. They sit in four places. The counter is served first because it is in front of you, and the WhatsApp order from the morning gets packed at six in the evening, if it is remembered.",
      "## Gap three: nothing confirms the order",
